# Capabilities tree gitignore.
#
# Policy: this directory holds capability *experiments*. We commit:
#   - rubric.py, build_corpus.py, oracle.sh         (the contract — reviewable)
#   - capability.md, capability.config.json         (the spec)
#   - capability.jsonl                              (append-only log)
#   - hypotheses/*.md                               (planning + verdicts)
#   - prompts/*.jsonl                               (your training prompts)
#   - datasets/train.opd.jsonl                      (your training data)
#   - calibration/{good,bad}.jsonl                  (rubric sanity)
#   - kiln-polish.jsonl                             (rough-edges ledger)
#   - run_iter*.sh, eval_adapter.sh, reproduce.sh   (replay scripts)
#   - manifest/<iter>.json                          (reproducibility manifest)
#
# We do NOT commit:

# --- Blind-eval firewall: never let eval contents or per-example judgments enter git ---
**/datasets/eval.jsonl
**/judgments/

# --- Adapter binaries: regenerable from training data + manifest + git SHA ---
# (the manifest + train.opd.jsonl + capability.config.json must be sufficient
#  to recompute the adapter; if you can't reproduce, that's a manifest bug)
**/adapters/

# --- Teacher fixture caches: large, regenerable from teacher + prompts ---
**/datasets/teacher.fixture*.jsonl
**/datasets/*.fixture.jsonl

# --- Live inspection / training artifacts ---
**/responses/
**/experiments/
**/.oracle-build/
**/.eval/

# --- All log files at any depth ---
**/*.log

# --- Python / Jupyter housekeeping ---
**/__pycache__/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.pyc
